<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais sets warrants on Taiwan fibre stocks.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets warrants on Taiwan fibre stocks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said it proposed to issue 25 million American style call warrants on a basket of six Taiwanese long Fibre stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Lealea Enterprise		4   shares</p>
<p> Universal Textile		2   shares</p>
<p> Li Peng Enterprise	     3   shares</p>
<p> Hong Yi Fiber		    3   shares</p>
<p> Zig Sheng Industrial	   2   shares</p>
<p> Everest Textile		  1   share</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	NT$401	  PREMIUM	 17 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 NT$6.817	GEARING	 5.88x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  03.SEPT.97    PAYDATE	 12.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     LUXEMBOURG    MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
